.Sh BUGS
Symbolic links specified on the command-line should be dereferenced.
Moreover, an option to follow symlinks should be provided,
given that the
.Fn ls
function powering this command already supports such a feature.
.Pp
An option to filter results by filesystem type
.Pq socket, FIFO, character or block device, regular file, etc
needs to be provided.
